+#    compact. Noise is forbidden near any dent footprint, keeping cleanup stable.
+# e) Visual observability:
+#    A human sees two repeated cues across examples: some black holes expand into
+#    larger 5x5 or 7x7 opposite-color squares, and some side-by-side boundary dents
+#    still transform even though their immediate 3x3 context looks ambiguous. No
